Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:22.19,Opening Romaji,,0,0,0,,mayotte modori susumu kido ga
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:30.78,Opening Romaji,,0,0,0,,hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:36.54,Opening Romaji,,0,0,0,,goal o soreta kibo ga atte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:45.30,Opening Romaji,,0,0,0,,mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai
